  "repository_summary": "Aspose.3D FOSS for .NET is a free, open-source implementation of Aspose.3D for .NET, licensed under MIT. It supports core 3D scene graph management, basic geometry primitives, and common file format I/O (OBJ, STL, FBX, glTF, etc.) for .NET platforms. The FOSS version intentionally omits rendering, advanced mesh operations, and proprietary format exports, with a clear commercial upgrade path.",
